{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_leto_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_leto_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "捉迷藏",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_leto_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c5a3bfa75602752b6f3bf49d39f381c766aa68196c5ea097d602ab014b444808",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "游戏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "你不是不想让妈妈去探险吗，妈妈呢，也不想突然消失，免得我的宝贝哭鼻子，所以就来玩个游戏吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我才不会哭鼻子咧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "我可还记得在舰桥上和妈妈重逢的时候，我的宝贝哭得那叫一个——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "停停停！明明是老妈你的身体还没完全恢复，又不是我故意不让你出去，为啥还要玩游戏啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "矿石病是治不好的，那么，又何来完全恢复一说呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "可是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "我当然知道我的宝贝是在关心我，但是，对一个探险家来说，最好的特效药始终是那些前所未见的景色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "最主要的是，要是妈妈真的想走的话，你觉得你拦得住妈妈吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......好啦，我知道啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "所以，什么游戏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "很简单，捉迷藏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "明天，妈妈会在舰内藏起来，如果下午你能找到妈妈的话，那妈妈这次就听你的，不出门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "但是，你要是没找到妈妈，那就要放弃阻止我去探险的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "欸，整艘船也太大了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "你可以找任何人帮忙，这样算公平吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "唔——好吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "那么，我就先去整理行李了，早点睡哦，宝贝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哼，别高兴得太早，我会找到你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔季扬娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1159_1",
      "text": "这才是我的乖女儿，那我就拭目以待咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......算了算了，早点睡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "明天还要去找老妈呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "对了，睡前给她们几个发个消息好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "“明天起来后帮我注意一下我妈的去向。食堂细说。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "发送，搞定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......唉，老妈的性格也太跳脱了，和她一比，我都算乖乖女了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "睡觉睡觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "char_115_headbr",
      "text": "我没看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯，不意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "char_115_headbr",
      "text": "什么意思？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "text": "我也没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "大小姐你不是和我妈关系挺好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "text": "我只是偶尔会和塔季扬娜女士交流一些化妆品心得而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "安娜呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "text": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "拉达......算了，我估计你也没见到。老妈看来是要玩真的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "text": "嗯？我看到了呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "text": "嗯，阿姨挺早的时候来食堂吃了一顿早餐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你倒是告诉我啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "text": "可是那时候你还在睡觉欸，而且，你又没说要及时告诉你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "呃，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "她有说她要去哪儿吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "text": "那个时候古米在做菜，没有听得太清，不过，好像听到了杜宾教官的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "杜宾教官？这么说起来，老妈确实有在杜宾教官那里复健。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "谢了，要是再有情况，记得告诉我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "text": "慢着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "text": "你还没说发生了什么呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "呃，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "char_115_headbr",
      "text": "嘁，我还以为发生什么事了呢，原来只是在玩游戏啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "这可不是单纯在玩游戏，要是我输了，老妈就要去探险了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "text": "那不是挺好的吗，为什么不让她去呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你说为什么，老妈她可是有矿石病的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "text": "但是——上次我们一起吃饭的时候，阿姨不是把体检报告拿出来给我们看过嘛，说是已经稳定下来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "就算暂时稳定下来了，也不能就这样马上开始跑跑跳跳吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "安娜，你看我干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "真理",
      "speakerId": "char_195_glassb",
      "text": "没什么，只是觉得这话从我们之中最不安分的你嘴里说出来还挺稀奇的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哎呀，反正你们要是晚饭前看到我妈了就给我发消息！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我先去杜宾教官那里看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "char_115_headbr",
      "text": "罗莎琳这家伙，一提到自己妈妈的病情，就变得跟平时完全不一样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "text": "毕竟，这也算是她唯一的心结了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "text": "自己的母亲为了自己而感染了矿石病，不会有人不耿耿于怀的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "char_115_headbr",
      "text": "但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "text": "你觉得，塔季扬娜女士真的需要我们担心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "char_115_headbr",
      "text": "......好吧，我们几个加起来，可能都不够那个阿姨耍的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "早露",
      "speakerId": "char_197_poca",
      "text": "所以，我们只要帮罗莎琳这个忙就是了，剩下的，交给她们自己吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "杜宾教官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "早啊，烈夏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我想知道，今天你见过我妈妈吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "塔季扬娜女士？她确实来过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那她现在还在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "不，她只是和我聊了会儿天就离开了，好像要继续做探险的准备。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "她除了探险，还和你聊了别的什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "她好像猜到你会来，让我把这个交给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "这是——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "室内攀岩绳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "这是妈妈经常用的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "嗯，你平时也有自己的课业和任务，所以不清楚也正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "塔季扬娜女士虽然力量方面并不出众，但是身手十分敏捷。那边那座攀岩墙的最快记录现在是由她保持的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "可以让我试一试吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "我就猜你会这么说，跟我来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "嗯，绳子固定好了，你可以去尝试一下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "老妈特意把绳子给我，多半在上面藏了点东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "看我轻轻松松爬上去，看看她到底葫芦里卖的什么药！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "呜哇啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "攀岩可不是那么简单的事情，你要学会找到支点，控制身体的平衡，可不是光靠蛮力就行的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "再来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "抓住了！然后是下一块——"
